From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominik Weber <doweb85@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:24:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/27] byteplan: model loading progress in the 503 response
 and the web UI

- server: the loading stages (text model, expert pool, MTP draft, vision) and their progress,
  reported by the existing load callbacks, are kept in the HTTP context and returned with
  the 503 "Loading model" error as error.progress {stage, stages, value, overall}
- web UI: ApiError carries the parsed error body, serverStore.loadProgress, the loading
  banner shows the overall percent, a progress bar and the current stage; polls every 500 ms
---
