 tools/server/server-http.cpp                  | 41 ++++++++++++++-----
 tools/server/server-http.h                    |  7 ++++
 tools/server/server.cpp                       | 20 ++++++---
 .../ChatScreen/ChatScreenServerError.svelte   | 35 +++++++++++++++-
 tools/ui/src/lib/stores/server.svelte.ts      | 24 ++++++++++-
 tools/ui/src/lib/utils/api-fetch.ts           | 25 ++++++-----
 7 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

